# Allow-list: only what the image build needs. Everything else stays out of
# the build context - in particular the station secrets (doa_settings.json
# holds the KrakenPro API key and the station location, api_token,
# server.key) and the 1.4 GB local uWebSockets clones (the Dockerfile fetches
# a pinned copy). librtlsdr is cloned at a pinned commit by the Dockerfile too.
*
!docker/
# licences + notices (scripts/collect-licenses.sh -> /usr/share/doc/krakensdr)
!LICENSE
!scripts/collect-licenses.sh
!heimdall_v2/LICENSE
!heimdall_v2/THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md
!kraken_doa_v2/LICENSE
!kraken_doa_v2/THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md
!kraken_doa_v2/COMMERCIAL_TERMS.md
!heimdall_v2/Makefile
!heimdall_v2/config.h
!heimdall_v2/index.html
!heimdall_v2/src/
!heimdall_v2/external/
!kraken_doa_v2/Makefile
# liquid-dsp's pinned build recipe (the Dockerfile fetches and builds it;
# a local kraken_doa_v2/liquid-dsp/ checkout stays out)
!kraken_doa_v2/liquid.mk
!kraken_doa_v2/include/
!kraken_doa_v2/src/
# vendored FFT library (pffft) the build compiles in
!kraken_doa_v2/external/
!kraken_doa_v2/kraken_doa.html
!kraken_doa_v2/array_calculator.html
!kraken_doa_v2/opus-decoder.min.js
!kraken_doa_v2/plugins/
kraken_doa_v2/plugins/*/build/
kraken_doa_v2/plugins/sdk/build/
# Voice to Text helper sources (the image clones whisper.cpp itself; local
# checkouts, builds and the speech models stay out)
!kraken_doa_v2/transcribe/
kraken_doa_v2/transcribe/whisper.cpp/
kraken_doa_v2/transcribe/build/
kraken_doa_v2/transcribe/models/
